          "whatsNew": "* Predictive back is back.\n* The web version only shows what works in a browser.\n* Google Drive backup is hidden on the web until the site has a Google sign-in client ID.\n* Text that said \"this phone\" says \"this browser\" on the web, and statement import asks you to keep the tab open instead of promising a notification.\n"
