          "whatsNew": "* Station names on the network map sit beside the track instead of on it.\n* Details on the map's station sheet opens the station page with everything showing, so there's no second \"More details\" tap.\n* Near me picked a station from whatever position the browser answered with first, which on a laptop can be a Wi-Fi or IP guess kilometres off.\n* The whole From and To card opens the station picker.\n"
